Z||000011||FieroKyle||11-13-2001||09:16 PM||||But, by itselfy, it looks just like a naked scoop, or a hump. I live the black wing, it goes well with the black trim that is found all around on the car.<P>I love the car with the wing. SO two thumbs up.<P>But I wouldn't put any thing more on it. I know you have the 383, but anything more other than an aero package and its gonna look ricey and gaudy. Keep it nice, and simple buyt with flavor. Know what I mean Gene?<p>[This message has been edited by FieroKyle (edited 11-13-2001).]||||reg||1
