Z||000015||FieroMontreal||11-13-2001||09:37 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Cozmo:<BR><B>Buy a few extra decklids of the same color, key them alike and put a different wing on each one of them.<BR>Then you could have a "Wing of the week" thing...  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/eek.gif"><P>BobC</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P><BR>Great Idea!<P><BR>Tina, IF you are going to keep the wing.. at least paint it Silver.. Usually I love black Wings on any color Fiero but with those Wing Stands it just looks wrong.. Don't get me wrong, I also love the tall spoiler idea.. but.. just not in black.. just my 0.02 cents.. car looks a lot better with out spoiler.<BR><P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/sigfieromontreal_1.gif">  <BR>1986 Fiero GT, STOCK Wingless, <BR>-Alex President of FieroMontreal... <A HREF="http://www.fieromontreal.com" TARGET=_blank>www.fieromontreal.com</A> <BR>and Regional Director of CFOG-I for Eastern Canada.||||reg||1
