Z||000029||Formula||11-14-2001||09:00 AM||||heres the same hood sccop with a smaller wing and the formula nose...<P>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Formularearscoop2.JPG">   <P>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Formulasidewheels1.JPG">   <P><BR>---Tina had hers first so I did infact copy, but she told me where to get one   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> ---<P>I say keep the wing, and if you dont like it trade me wings !  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">  I think the wing makes the car look a lot more super-car-ish.  Oher then that leave it the way it is.<p>[This message has been edited by Formula (edited 11-14-2001).]||||reg||1
