Z||000032||sqoach||11-14-2001||10:56 AM||||It looks perfect how it is. NO WING!<BR>It just doesn't look like it belongs. Even if it were body-colored, it would look kinda weird. Plus, it will be so much harder to see out the back, I would think. Just looks like there's too much goin' on in the back, and nuthin up front. Maybe if you had like a custom air-dam for that bumper, it would look better. But I think your car looks awesome how it is!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>------------------<BR>-Adam<BR><FONT COLOR="BLUE">sqoach@yahoo.com</FONT><BR>               <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/sigsqoach2.gif">              <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/fullstaff.gif">               <BR>^^^^^<B>new project</B>^^^^^<BR><FONT SIZE="1"><LI>86 SC 2.5L 5spd</FONT>||||reg||1
