Z||000036||Bazooka||11-14-2001||12:56 PM||||I have high wing stanchions with a similar "twin snorkel" scoop on back(similar to Tina's) and there is more visibilty than the standard Fiero GT wings. So visibilty should not be an issue. Tina may need to also add a 'Rodney Strut' to compensate for the weight of her new wing.||||reg||1
Z||000037||Jefrysuko||11-14-2001||01:33 PM||||I say keep the wing but move it back on the decklid as far as possible that way it doesn't look like it is interfering with the scoop.||||reg||1
